  "name": "Grand Duchy of Karameikos",
  "description": "The setting of the Basic Set itself — a young, formally-a-Duchy-but-effectively-a-kingdom nation on Mystara's Known World, carved out of the 'uncivilized' wilds of Traladara some thirty years ago by the Thyatian noble Stefan Karameikos. A divided land: a Traladaran majority, free-spirited and superstitious, ruled by a pragmatic, conquest-minded Thyatian nobility who never fully trust each other. The coastal capital of Specularum is civilized; the deep, wild interior very much is not — exactly the kind of frontier the Basic and Expert rules were written to send low-level adventurers into.",
